---
// Phase 0 placeholder home page.
// Real StudioTable home is built in Phase 2 per spec/implementation-plan.md.
// This file exists to satisfy the Phase 0 exit criterion: "placeholder home deploys green on Cloudflare."
// Real OKLCH tokens land in src/styles/tokens.css during Phase 1.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Portfolio site in build phase. Phase 0 placeholder; full site lands at launch." />
    <title>Portfolio — in build</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-stage: oklch(0.14 0.008 65);
        --ink: oklch(0.92 0.012 65);
        --ink-muted: oklch(0.62 0.010 65);
        --key-light: oklch(0.74 0.160 65);
      }

      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html,
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: var(--bg-stage);
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        font-family: serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      main {
        max-width: 38rem;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4.5vw, 2.6rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      h1 span {
        color: var(--key-light);
      }

      p {
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
        max-width: 65ch;
      }

      code {
        font-family: monospace;
        color: var(--key-light);
        font-size: 0.92em;
      }

      .meta {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        opacity: 0.7;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Portfolio <span>in build</span></h1>
      <p>Phase 0 placeholder. The real home page lands in Phase 2.</p>
      <p>Current state: Astro 5 scaffold up, CI gates wired (desktop + mobile Lighthouse), design system locked, OKLCH tokens deferred to Phase 1.</p>
      <p>
        Routes coming online during the build:
        <code>/projects/podcast</code>,
        <code>/projects/doc-extractor</code>,
        <code>/projects/ai-design-team</code>,
        <code>/about</code>,
        <code>/contact</code>,
        <code>/now</code>.
      </p>
      <p class="meta">Build started 2026-05-22. Launch target 2026-06-21.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
